# Contact form backend (optional)
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Paste your endpoint below (example: https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxx)
# 3. Restart the Vite dev server / rebuild
# Without this variable, the contact form opens a mailto: draft to indudyes@gmail.com
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=